  "corrections": [
    {
      "id": "p07165-f8345cba1765",
      "source": "I thought she kept me there for years. Wandering her woods, listening to her singing, lying on beds of flowers.",
      "source_sha256": "f8345cba17657f6dbd81c88845b45bd06117e219d3eca51b0a5105d6a4306812",
      "original_target": "我以为她把我留在那里好多年。我在她的林间漫步，听她唱歌，躺在鲜花铺成的床上。",
      "corrected_target": "我感觉她把我留在了那里好多年。我在她的林间漫步，听她唱歌，躺在鲜花铺成的床上。",
      "kind": "text",
      "reason": "thought表达对停留时长的主观感受；后文明确仙境多年在人间仅过一夜。按用户确认改为感觉，避免以为暗示后来证实判断错误。",
      "origins": [
        "translation/sol-full-2026-10-09/inputs/b0051.json:p07165-f8345cba1765",
        "resources.assets:scenes:6f4f49b19b3822498a7941716ea1353b8e9073dc4873406fa0fc351170acea0a:OTH_OthelloStorytimePrivate1:19567",
        "translation/sol-full-2026-10-09/inputs/b0052.json:p07175-ea152c1d56df",
        "用户实际游玩中英文截图及确认，2026-10-15"
      ],
      "apply_at_export": true,
      "additional_model_calls": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "p07167-c35c01cc5880",
      "source": "Were... you... did you and she... lie together intimately?",
      "source_sha256": "c35c01cc5880391afc7ad473741b6d27a272a4ba9b8093099e48c02a7821df18",
      "original_target": "你们……你……你和她……亲密地同床过吗？",
      "corrected_target": "你……你和她……有过肌肤之亲吗？",
      "kind": "text",
      "reason": "Were... you...是未说完又改口的迟疑，不支持将单独you译成你们；以肌肤之亲自然表达lie together intimately的委婉性含义，保留结巴与疑问。",
      "origins": [
        "translation/sol-full-2026-10-09/inputs/b0051.json:p07167-c35c01cc5880",
        "resources.assets:scenes:6f4f49b19b3822498a7941716ea1353b8e9073dc4873406fa0fc351170acea0a:OTH_OthelloStorytimePrivate1:19571",
        "用户实际游玩中英文截图反馈，2026-10-15"
      ],
      "apply_at_export": true,
      "additional_model_calls": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "p07170-9ac8238bb4ff",
      "source": "In some sick way, I <i>wanted</i> her to consume my heart, too. I wanted to give in. But I couldn't. Something wouldn't let me.",
      "source_sha256": "9ac8238bb4ff761817fce36d083ebd53da92086744e2468d61872fc3b80a717f",
      "original_target": "出于某种病态的念头，我也<i>想</i>让她吞食我的心。我想屈服。可我做不到。有某种东西不让我这么做。",
      "corrected_target": "说来有些病态，我也<i>想</i>让她吞食我的心。我想屈服。可我做不到。有某种东西不让我这么做。",
      "kind": "text",
      "reason": "In some sick way是对自身渴望的评价，旧译出于某种病态的念头引入原因说明；按用户确认改为说来有些病态，保留wanted斜体强调及其余文字。",
